config.prompt:
Score this lead from 0-100 on fit and intent.

Lead:
- Name: {{input.name}}
- Company: {{input.company}}
- Email: {{input.email}}
- Phone: {{input.phone}}
- Source: {{input.source}}
- Message: {{input.message}}

Weigh company signal, how specific and serious the message is, and how complete the contact details are. Return ONLY JSON: { "score": number (0-100), "qualified": boolean (score >= 60), "reasoning": string }.

config.code:
// Set this to your own scheduling link when you set up the template.
const baseUrl = input.bookingBaseUrl || "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_BOOKING_LINK";
const params = new URLSearchParams({ name: input.name || "", email: input.email || "", company: input.company || "" });
return { ...input, bookingLink: baseUrl + "?" + params.toString(), email: input.email, name: input.name };
